        </div>

    </section>

    <!-- OUR STORY -->

    <section class="story-section">

        <div class="container">

            <div class="row align-items-center g-5">

                <div class="col-lg-6">

                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1527631746610-bca00a040d60?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80"
                        class="img-fluid rounded-4 shadow-lg" alt="Image">

                </div>

                <div class="col-lg-6">

                    <h2 class="section-title text-start">

                        Our Story

                    </h2>

                    <div class="divider ms-0"></div>

                    <p class="story-text">

                        Homigo was founded with a simple yet ambitious goal:
                        to redefine how people discover and book accommodations.

                        We noticed that travelers often struggled with
                        complicated booking platforms,
                        hidden charges,
                        unreliable property information,
                        and poor customer support.

                    </p>

                    <p class="story-text">

                        That's why we built Homigo—
                        a platform that combines
                        trust,
                        transparency,
                        technology,
                        and hospitality
                        into one seamless experience.

                    </p>

                    <p class="story-text">

                        Every property listed on Homigo is carefully verified,
                        every booking is protected,
                        and every traveler receives dedicated customer support,
                        ensuring peace of mind throughout the journey.

                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

    </section>

